    "body": "Thought I'd share my highlighting rules for mini.hipatterns, which mimics folke's `todo-comments` in the event others might be interested.\r\n\r\nSpecifically, it ensures the keyword's reverse text has a single space on the left and right side of the word. The space on the right side is created by hiding the colon using the same fg and bg color. Finally, it uses the reverse color as the foreground for the remainder of the line.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n      opts.highlighters = {\r\n        hex_color   = hipatterns.gen_highlighter.hex_color(),\r\n        fixme       = { pattern = \"() FIXME():\",   group = \"MiniHipatternsFixme\" },\r\n        hack        = { pattern = \"() HACK():\",    group = \"MiniHipatternsHack\" },\r\n        todo        = { pattern = \"() TODO():\",    group = \"MiniHipatternsTodo\" },\r\n        note        = { pattern = \"() NOTE():\",    group = \"MiniHipatternsNote\" },\r\n        fixme_colon = { pattern = \" FIXME():()\",   group = \"MiniHipatternsFixmeColon\" },\r\n        hack_colon  = { pattern = \" HACK():()\",    group = \"MiniHipatternsHackColon\" },\r\n        todo_colon  = { pattern = \" TODO():()\",    group = \"MiniHipatternsTodoColon\" },\r\n        note_colon  = { pattern = \" NOTE():()\",    group = \"MiniHipatternsNoteColon\" },\r\n        fixme_body  = { pattern = \" FIXME:().*()\", group = \"MiniHipatternsFixmeBody\" },\r\n        hack_body   = { pattern = \" HACK:().*()\",  group = \"MiniHipatternsHackBody\" },\r\n        todo_body   = { pattern = \" TODO:().*()\",  group = \"MiniHipatternsTodoBody\" },\r\n        note_body   = { pattern = \" NOTE:().*()\",  group = \"MiniHipatternsNoteBody\" },\r\n      }\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"933\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/747855/b3e2db3b-ca98-4697-b893-fa3ff09c9cac\">\r\n\r\nFor comparison, here is the version using `mini.extras.gen_highlighter`:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n      local hi_words = require(\"mini.extra\").gen_highlighter.words\r\n      -- stylua: ignore\r\n      opts.highlighters = {\r\n        hex_color = hipatterns.gen_highlighter.hex_color(),\r\n        fixme = hi_words({ \"FIXME\" }, \"MiniHipatternsFixme\"),\r\n        todo  = hi_words({ \"TODO\" },  \"MiniHipatternsTodo\"),\r\n        note  = hi_words({ \"NOTE\" },  \"MiniHipatternsNote\"),\r\n        hack  = hi_words({ \"HACK\" },  \"MiniHipatternsHack\"),\r\n      }\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"933\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/747855/13ecd1fb-df51-46b4-a3be-b7a48289b5fc\">\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thought I'd share my highlighting rules for mini.hipatterns, which mimics folke's <code class=\"notranslate\">todo-comments</code> in the event others might be interested.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Specifically, it ensures the keyword's reverse text has a single space on the left and right side of the word. The space on the right side is created by hiding the colon using the same fg and bg color. Finally, it uses the reverse color as the foreground for the remainder of the line.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"      opts.highlighters = {\n        hex_color   = hipatterns.gen_highlighter.hex_color(),\n        fixme       = { pattern = &quot;() FIXME():&quot;,   group = &quot;MiniHipatternsFixme&quot; },\n        hack        = { pattern = &quot;() HACK():&quot;,    group = &quot;MiniHipatternsHack&quot; },\n        todo        = { pattern = &quot;() TODO():&quot;,    group = &quot;MiniHipatternsTodo&quot; },\n        note        = { pattern = &quot;() NOTE():&quot;,    group = &quot;MiniHipatternsNote&quot; },\n        fixme_colon = { pattern = &quot; FIXME():()&quot;,   group = &quot;MiniHipatternsFixmeColon&quot; },\n        hack_colon  = { pattern = &quot; HACK():()&quot;,    group = &quot;MiniHipatternsHackColon&quot; },\n        todo_colon  = { pattern = &quot; TODO():()&quot;,    group = &quot;MiniHipatternsTodoColon&quot; },\n        note_colon  = { pattern = &quot; NOTE():()&quot;,    group = &quot;MiniHipatternsNoteColon&quot; },\n        fixme_body  = { pattern = &quot; FIXME:().*()&quot;, group = &quot;MiniHipatternsFixmeBody&quot; },\n        hack_body   = { pattern = &quot; HACK:().*()&quot;,  group = &quot;MiniHipatternsHackBody&quot; },\n        todo_body   = { pattern = &quot; TODO:().*()&quot;,  group = &quot;MiniHipatternsTodoBody&quot; },\n        note_body   = { pattern = &quot; NOTE:().*()&quot;,  group = &quot;MiniHipatternsNoteBody&quot; },\n      }\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">      <span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">highlighters</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">hex_color</span>   <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">hipatterns</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">gen_highlighter</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">hex_color</span>(),\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">fixme</span>       <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>() FIXME():<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,   <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsFixme<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">hack</span>        <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>() HACK():<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsHack<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">todo</span>        <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>() TODO():<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsTodo<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">note</span>        <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>() NOTE():<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsNote<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">fixme_colon</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> FIXME():()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,   <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsFixmeColon<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">hack_colon</span>  <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> HACK():()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsHackColon<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">todo_colon</span>  <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> TODO():()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsTodoColon<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">note_colon</span>  <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> NOTE():()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsNoteColon<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">fixme_body</span>  <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> FIXME:().*()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsFixmeBody<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">hack_body</span>   <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> HACK:().*()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,  <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsHackBody<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">todo_body</span>   <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> TODO:().*()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,  <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsTodoBody<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">note_body</span>   <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> NOTE:().*()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,  <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniHipatternsNoteBody<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n      }</pre></div>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/747855/320242808-b3e2db3b-ca98-4697-b893-fa3ff09c9cac.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6Im